sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff as Required reviewer
    participant API as Staff API
    participant Service as Case service
    participant DB as Case store
    participant WF as Native Workflow
    Note over Service,DB: Action ledger is stored in this same application database
    Staff->>API: Review response, reason and supporting evidence
    API->>Service: Respond to review
    Service->>DB: Load current review, scope, claims and policy
    Service->>Service: Check role, status, scope, expiry and evidence
    alt Stale, expired, duplicate or invalid response
        Service-->>API: Reject; permissions do not change
    else Response is valid for this requirement
        Service->>DB: Commit response, assessment, event and wake intent
        Service-->>API: Current assessment with all remaining blockers
        API-->>WF: Wake after commit
        WF->>Service: Fresh run_case_cycle
        Service->>DB: Reload evidence, active policy and scoped grants
        Service->>Service: Reassess every requirement
        alt A blocker remains
            Service-->>WF: Retain action hold and next deadline
        else Outcome is ACT
            Service->>DB: Record intent, simulated provider receipt and result
            Note over Service,DB: Stable business-action ID prevents duplicate simulation
            Service-->>WF: Commit checkpoint and next wake
        end
    end
    Note over Staff,WF: One approval never waives the other requirements
